Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she took a cut from all the whores, ran the black market,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,anything you can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She ran it with her husband at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but when he died in the war she ran it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when she became known as the Widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,At first everyone thought it would all fall apart with her in charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but she earned respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She was incredibly cynical and was soon feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,For many years she didn't care about men at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,then she began taking lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, at one point she had an affair with your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.48,0:00:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,even though he was married.
